  "source": "## Semantics: B1, B2, B3, B4, C3, K1, A1, A3, M0\ngrammar ConformanceBindingsArray version \"1.0.0\" mode \"v1\" {\n  ## Comma-separated integers bound as an array of objects.\n  item = 1*%x30-39 as n\n  main = item *( \",\" item )\n\n  bindings main {\n    n -> items[].n (integer)\n  }\n\n  entry main: main\n\n  test main {\n    example \"1,2\" { items: [ { n: 1 }, { n: 2 } ] }\n    example \"7\" { items: [ { n: 7 } ] }\n    reject \"1,\"\n  }\n}\n",
